      "revision": 110541045,
      "text": "クスノキ（樟、楠）は、クスノキ科の常緑高木の1種（図1）。クスともよばれる。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia 英語版「Camphora officinarum」",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Camphora_officinarum",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-09",
      "revision": 1376614537,
      "text": "Camphora officinarum is a species of evergreen tree indigenous to warm temperate to subtropical regions of East Asia, including countries such as China, Taiwan, Vietnam, Korea, Japan and India. It is known by various names, most notably the camphor tree, camphorwood or camphor laurel."
    }
